[SIZE=4][B]Gathering and resource processing[/B][/SIZE]
Selected mining and woodcutting profiles include tool requirements, XP, resource depletion and restoration. Smelting and smithing have separate material, output and failure checks.

[SPOILER=Gathering and mining]
