[SIZE=4][B]Food and consumables[/B][/SIZE]
Selected foods and drinks cover healing, multiple bites, returned containers and stat effects. Individual item rules are checked rather than treating every consumable alike.

[SPOILER=Food and consumables]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/main/images/server-openrune/06-crab-food.png[/IMG]
[I]Rust-server native integration capture — an independent giant-crab-meat test after five selected Eat actions. UI-focused capture; the scene camera is incomplete. Health and item transitions were checked alongside the image.[/I]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/main/images/server-openrune/07-wine-effects.png[/IMG]
[I]Rust-server native integration capture — a separate wine test showing Attack drained to zero. The run checked healing and retained jugs. This is a UI-focused verification capture, not a complete world-rendering demonstration.[/I]
[/SPOILER]

[SIZE=4][B]Scenery and everyday interactions[/B][/SIZE]
Recent content includes selected searches, pickables, chests, drawers, ladders, stairs and other small interactions. Each needs its own bindings and verification.

[SPOILER=Scenery interactions]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/main/images/server-openrune/08-empty-search.png[/IMG]
[I]Rust-server native integration capture — native movement followed by a reached Search action and the “nothing” reply. This bounded search feature has separate independent verification.[/I]
[/SPOILER]

[SIZE=4][B]Other implemented work[/B][/SIZE]
These areas have development or integration tests, but are not all demonstrated by the screenshots above:
[LIST]
[*]Melee, ranged and elemental-spell rules; rune/ammunition checks, combat XP and prayer selection/drain.
[*]Cooking and baking, dough and pie assembly, gem cutting, glassblowing, pottery, jewellery, spinning, weaving and selected leatherwork.
[*]Equipment changes, NPC routing and dialogue, death/loot handling, item packs and selected use-item interactions.
[*]Shop transaction and stock rules. Broad world-shop registration is still incomplete.
[/LIST]
These are selected implementations and bounded checks, not claims that every skill, NPC, item or encounter is finished. Broader native combat and loot verification remains work in progress.

